{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RhNHgrChbu1795584017.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國俄亥俄州辛辛那提動物園的明星河馬Fiona，日前誤吞冷帽致死。驗屍報告顯示，Fiona誤吞的冷帽，被卡在小腸中部，距離胃部大約7米。園方現已重新開放河馬園區（Hippo Cove），並加強保護措施，避免同類型事件再次發生。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.HIPPO-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IuQoBhtuCn1795188005.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>動物園主管表示，河馬棲息園區符合動物園及水族館協會（AZA）制定的嚴格標準，但為避免同類型事件再次發生，已在園區作相應改造。園方周一發表聲明表示，已於玻璃觀賞窗上方加裝防護網，並移除所有天花板風扇。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"NOV 21 FIONA HIPPO.JPG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QiXqwZLpxH1795237292.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>Fiona因誤吞一頂意外吹入河馬園區的冷帽，上周四死於併發症。由於河馬的生理構造，獸醫無法為Fiona進行影像檢查，或施手術取出異物。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:04:02.497972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:26.820673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:24.211569+00:00","content_hash":"0a1b4a4bf9dda7e4a599095e935051b7a19dc4a3a9ccbcb47d26f42e50899502","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:04:02.497972+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}